   System Science, Henan Polytechn Univ, Jiaozuo, PEOPLES R CHINA, MAY
   15-17, 2008},
Abstract = {This paper introduces the conception of land information and the
   functions of ontology in information sharing in the first place. And
   based on the principles of ontology design and information
   classification and the analysis of features of land information, this
   paper concludes the semantic characters of land information. After that
   this paper takes urban land use types as an example, and establishes the
   picture of conception system of urban land use which can express clearly
   the semantic meaning of urban land use types. For providing the
   conveniences to computer process of the information of land domain, the
   conception system has been formalization expressed by OWL language. This
   work can be the foundation of knowledge databases based on ontology and
   experts' knowledge database, and can impulse the development of standard
   of land domain information.},
