   Changsha, PEOPLES R CHINA, NOV 16, 2009},
Organization = {Sustainable Dev City Grp; Cent S Univ, Hunan Inst Syst Engn \&
   Management},
Abstract = {The efficiency of the urban economic operations has a close bearing on
   the rapid, healthy and sustainable growth of the cities. The modified
   DEA model is employed to estimate the efficiency of economic operations
   of 16 cities in the Yangtze River Delta megalopolis, and analyze its
   economic growth situation from the perspective of relative efficiency,
   to identify the factors that restrain the efficiency of economic
