   identify types and facilities of Islamic School in Perak and area
   regeneration contribution to the school. The methods adopted for this
   study are document analysis and survey questionnaire that had been
   distributed to the parents and teacher of the Islamic school. The result
   indicates that the respondent agreed that facilities provided at the
