Abstract = {During the process of rural urbanization, people move from village to
   town, however the original communities are broken up, the nature
   connection between farmers disappeared partly, the effect of traditional
   life-style on psychology and life changed with time gone. Some
   conventional culture has been changed in this process. Some folk culture
   will disappear if we do not carry out any action to protect. Three
   traditional folk culture heritage protection modes are summarized in
