Abstract = {It is known, that all most ancient centers of the civilization have
   developed along the thirtieth northern parallel. They have taken a
   narrow band from the Atlantic ocean coast up to tbe Pacific one:
   ``...This band is less than the twelfth part of all earth surface; it
   contains fertile soil, scattered between the deserts, steppes and
   mountain logs...{''} {[}K. Yaspers]. To my mind, this
   historical-geographical phenomenon is explained by the fact that the
   given ``band{''} is located in the zone of high seismic activity.
   The forces fluctuating the Earth surface seemed to be divine and
   incomprehen-sible. People named that spiritual substance differently -
   Egyptian Nun, Babylon Apsy, antique Chaos, Indian Brachman, Chinese
   Tsi.... It's immortalized in different structures, those look like
   clinker. Here refer the ``balancing{''} columns of the Mines palaces,
   the famous curvatures of the Creek temples of a classical period, plump,
   like unusual tropical fruits, cult buildings of the Ancient India,
   refined bent roofs of Chinese houses. The ancient architects have shown,
   that there are no direct lines in the nature. Therefore their creations
   are full of life. They remind to people of our planet unsteadiness and
   of the mighty forces threatening to mankind also.},
