Abstract = {Nowadays the petroleum oil crisis is leading to the use of renewable
   sources of energy. This paper examines the use of diesel-sunflower oil
   mixtures in diesel engines. The mixtures used are the following:
   diesel-10\% sunflower oil, diesel-20\% sunflower oil, diesel-30\%
   sunflower oil, diesel-40\% sunflower oil, diesel-50\% sunflower oil.
