   2006},
Abstract = {In response to the `asthma epidemic', local organisations in San
   Francisco formed the Yes We Can Urban Asthma Partnership, which uses a
   comprehensive medical/social model for paediatric asthma care. The Yes
   We Can Urban Asthma Partnership reaches out to high-risk children in
   different clinical settings: urgent visits, the hospital, a
   comprehensive specialty asthma clinic, and through an expanded community
   health worker programme. This article highlights the initial
   development, implementation, and evaluation of the success of this
   innovative management programme to address the problem of paediatric
   asthma in underserved urban areas.},
