Abstract = {Haikou Qilou is a kind of residential and commercial building types
   which rise in the late 19th century to early 20th century. This special
   architectural style combines with architectural culture of southern
   china and western architectural culture, resulting in the buildings with
   strong regional and times features. It witnessed the development of
   urban \& architectural culture of Haikou City. It becomes a microcosm of
   the modern cultural exchanges between East and West in the China's
   southeastern coastal areas. It has important historical and artistic
