   Forest \& Range Expt Stn, SW Reg, Coronado Natl Forest},
Abstract = {Fire is a natural phenomenon in Madrean Province ecosystems. Suppression
   of natural fire has altered ecosystem processes, however. Recognition of
   these alterations has led to the adoption of let-burn policies by many
   management agencies, but a let-burn policy has become less viable in
   recent years in the opinion of many people. There are barriers to a
   let-burn policy that should be weighed against the possible benefits
   before deciding upon the proper course of action relative to acceptance
   or rejection of the policy.},
